WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:06.540
SUCHITRA HARI: My
name is Suchitra Hari.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.230
I'm the Director of Engineering
for Shared Services at WP

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.310
Engine.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.530
Shared services
is a team that is

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:18.690
focused on our internal
stakeholders at WP Engine.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.150
A bulk of our
focus is on solving

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:25.320
for common problems that happen
across multiple different

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.150
product lines.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.050
And the goal is to solve the
problems holistically instead

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.670
of one project at a time.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.220
The idea is for our
developers to be

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.710
more in control
of when they ship

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:41.850
and what they ship and
standardize on common concerns

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.610
and, hence, help our
customers when online.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.460
I do want to talk
about the team here.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:49.410
It sounds as if this
is a very big team.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.820
It's actually a very small team.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.690
We have a product manager,
an engineering manager,

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:57.330
and a solid five-member
engineering team.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:01.110
And so far, our adoption
rates have been excellent.

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:02.700
And its ever-growing.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.519
Every few weeks, we're
onboarding a new engineering

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:08.400
team into our platform, a new
service or a new application

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.630
into our platform.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:15.310
So far, we've released about
27 applications and services.

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:18.180
And as I speak, I think that
number is growing, growing.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:23.130
The improvements to reliability
and our ability to deploy code

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:25.990
with an element of confidence--

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:28.080
it just means that
this is more time

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.520
back for our application
development team members

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.430
to build powerful
WordPress products that's

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.890
going to help our
customers when online.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.900
I'm excited about
the possibilities.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.210
And I think we could
be taking-- unleashing

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:44.050
the power of--
full power of Cloud

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:46.620
to a whole new
level at this point.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.710
And that's just going to really
help our WP Engine customers

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:50.910
with online, ultimately.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:54.900
It's a huge honor to accept this
award on behalf of WP Engine

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.680
and our amazing engineers in
the Catalyst software delivery

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.900
platform team.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.300
This recognition comes at
a time where we've just

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.510
started reaping rewards of
investing in the software

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:11.670
delivery platform built on
top of Google's product suite.

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:13.450
Like I said, this
is an embodiment.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:18.630
Our investment in the SDP is an
embodiment of our core value,

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:19.740
built for growth.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:24.030
Being able to experience
lighter operational burden,

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.180
high availability, and an
ability to scale rapidly

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:31.120
is really important for WP
Engine's growth at this point.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.310
So thank you.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.680
Like I said, I'm super
excited about seeing

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:37.110
what unleashing the
full power of Cloud

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:41.220
is going to bring in for WP
Engine in the coming months

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.720
and years--

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.810
so super excited.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.550
Thank you.

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:47.900
[MUSIC PLAYING]

